WEBVTT

00:05:29.825 --> 00:05:32.536
I've come up with a philosophy
that does just this.

00:05:32.536 --> 00:05:34.789
And it all starts with one simple idea.

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:40.211
Cooking, cleaning, laundry,

00:05:40.211 --> 00:05:42.505
it doesn't make you a good person.

00:05:43.172 --> 00:05:44.632
Or a bad person.

00:05:46.008 --> 00:05:47.134
Listen to me.

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:52.139
Care tasks are morally neutral.

00:05:54.934 --> 00:05:58.270
Now, I know that if you've been watching
Martha Stewart for decades --

00:05:58.312 --> 00:05:59.605
(Laughter)

00:05:59.647 --> 00:06:03.984
and scrolling the perfect
Pinterest aesthetic every day,